                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game got old in 4 min, I actually had to start it up again and let it sit there, just to get 5 min so i could write this review. It is not worth $9, it would hardly be worth $2. This game feels like it is riding the VR wave and plays like it was made in a weekend. If you hit the button above the touchpad repeatedly you can teleport yourself out of the arena. It is really great since there isn't a pause menu so you have to let the clock run out everytime if you accidentally hit the button and then can no longer hit any of the pitches. \n\n\nDo not buy this game, save your money.",
